      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE’s Spring/Summer 2027 men’s show just wrapped at the Tennis Club de Paris. Titled “Tough & Tender,” creative director Michael Rider mixed Victorian capes and vintage shirts with sharp tailoring, double-breasted jackets, New Wave graphic tees, preppy knits, bohemian headbands, and slouchy bags—celebrating fashion’s vitality, fluidity, and endless possibilities for free-form styling.",
