      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Slouchy Bags ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This season’s bags feel effortlessly relaxed in both silhouette and wear. The new backpack, crafted from soft, supple Nappa leather, takes on a hobo shape—like a hastily tied bundle you grab on your way out. Models wore them slung over the neck or across the back, channeling a rebellious, hippie-inspired spirit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
