      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Halfmoon bag is one of the season’s most-worn silhouettes. Made from Nappa leather or nylon, its two-way zip opening allows easy access, while the adjustable strap enables shoulder or crossbody wear. The soft, relaxed shape keeps that effortless French vibe going.",
