      "text": "Mini charm bags are perfect for stashing earbuds, phones, and other small essentials. Their pocket-sized proportions become the statement of any outfit. Cylinder bags are sculpted from solid leather with a three-dimensional silhouette, and the iconic Triomphe logo is embossed on the side for a playful, lighthearted touch.",
